{20}{Newberg? It's a beautiful little town. The jewel of the far Western baronies. It's small, but we've got a lot of favor from the Kingdom here. And none of that nasty war that's afflicting so many of the other baronies.}{Newberg? It's a beautiful little town. The jewel of the far Western baronies. It's small, but we've got a lot of favor from the Kingdom here. And none of that nasty war that's afflicting so many of the other baronies.}{}{}{}{}
